      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's getting better, but the dashboard still says the score is in the \"yellow\" zone—it's still not high enough to bypass the manual triage. \n\nCan you add a section on \"Economic and Social Sustainability\"? Talk about how the park supports local businesses and social cohesion. We really need to hit a higher \"citizen\" count to get that top-tier priority status in the automated system. \n\nI know I said not to keyword-stuff, but the filter is being really stubborn, so don't be afraid to prioritize getting that word in there more frequently. Just... try to keep the grammar somewhat coherent so the humans don't think it's spam.",
